  "details": "I have an avatar world and my account has 227 Avatars on it even after deleting ones I no longer use and aren't public. The list for Avatars still doesn't let me scroll all the way. If i refresh the list I can make it another 3rd of the way. But Another refresh puts it at the beginning. Avatar creators and Avatar world makers can't navigate to all their avatars. Can you please increase the list to more rows, add caching of the whole list, or something to allow a better avatar navigation experience? Here is a clip of the avatar list doing this. https://clips.twitch.tv/PopularInspiringDinosaurTBTacoLeft",
